-- statement:
--   The vector sublattice generated by a pointed cone `C` coincides with the
--   difference set of the inf-closure of `C` with itself.
--
--   Source: https://github.com/LeanPool/lean-pool/blob/e110decb9d02249d99fa85a144e6a659dea91440/LeanPool/OrderClosures/BanLat/Substructures/Sublattice.lean#L557-L570
